===== Specific Configuration =====
==== Interfaces ====

The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description          ^ Default configuration   ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi           | 192.168.1.1/24          |
| vlan1 (eth1)     | LAN ports (1 to 4)   | DHCP Server                    |
| eth0             | WAN port             | DHCP                    |
| wlan0              | WiFi    (2.4GHz)         | <color #ed1c24>Disabled</color>                |
| wlan1              | WiFi    (5GHz)           | <color #ed1c24>Disabled</color>                |

==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
The numbers labelled on the case do not match the logical port numbers.  If you use VLANs, pay attention to this numbering scheme.
^ Physical port   ^ Switch port   ^
| Ethernet 1      | 2             |
| Ethernet 2      | 3             |
| Ethernet 3      | 4             |
| Ethernet 4      | 1             |
| CPU (eth1)      | 0             |

The yellow "Internet" port is connected directly to the other CPU port, eth0.  It is not part of the switch.
